To add to Terrys comment. You can fit the model in lavaan but you'll need to specify all conditional indirect effects by hand. I'd recommend taking a look at the following paper, which  describes the issue and has accompanying Mplus code for some similar models (here: http://www.afhayes.com/public/mplus1to5.pdf):

Preacher, K. J., Rucker, D. D., & Hayes, A. F. (2007).  Assessing moderated mediation hypotheses: Theory, methods, and prescriptions.  Multivariate Behavioral Research, 42, 185-227. [ <http://www.quantpsy.org/pubs/preacher_rucker_hayes_2007.pdf>PDF <http://www.quantpsy.org/pubs/preacher_rucker_hayes_2007.pdf>]

