Noelia--
     You probably need to do a bit of reading on structural equation modeling.  Degrees of freedom for the chi-square statistic is not affected by sample size, but rather by the number of observed variables (and the number of free parameters).
     Yes, the values under "Estimator" in the lavaan output are the values for your model.
     Your sample sizes are rather small for such a model, so the chi-square statistic is probably under-powered.
--Ed Rigdon

Sent from my iPad

